    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d338">

                <pb facs="0378" n="304" xml:id="pg304"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/8261</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Special Mission</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Auchincloss</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-11T20:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 11, 1917, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 10.35 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>For Polk:</p>
                <p>Conferences in Paris postponed until November 22. We remain here for another week
                    at least and do not return here after leaving. Prime Minister and military
                    authorities return first of this week. Conferences proceeding satisfactorily.
                    Members of the commission are making very favorable impression according to
                    Wiseman. Balfour says our visit could not
                    have come at better time. McCormick and
                        Taylor very anxious to see ministers
                    to northern neutrals. Please answer to our cable. Advise family well.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Auchincloss</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
